    "Scan of the 1954 edition of the Rio Bravo, California, topographic map at 1:24,000 scale (7.5 x 7.5 minute series), published by the U.S. Geological Survey. Surveyed in 1928; aerial photographs from 1973; field checked in 1954; photo inspected in 1973; photo revised in 1968; printed in 1984.",
    "Variations: woodland tint. Sheet size: 22 x 27 inches. Printed projection: Polyconic; horizontal datum: NAD27. From the USGS Historical Topographic Map Collection."
